# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output. Published to npm from a fresh build — see prepublishOnly.
dist/

# The handoff brief: planning notes and product strategy, not part of the tool.
BRIEF.md

# stet's own working state at the repo root. Only sessions/ is transient now —
# this repo is governed by its own tool, so its canon and its notes are shared.
# Note the leading slash: showcase/.stet IS committed, because the decisions
# taken there are the story.
/.stet/*
# …except the notes. They are facts about this codebase that were expensive to
# learn, and a contributor cloning this repo should get them delivered at the
# moment they touch the file, not have to rediscover them.
!/.stet/NOTES.md
# …and the canon, and the decisions it was earned from. This repo is governed by
# its own tool; a contributor should get the rules and the landmines delivered,
# not have to rediscover them. Only sessions/ is per-developer.
!/.stet/RULES.md
!/.stet/decided/
!/.stet/decided/**
/AGENTS.md

# Local Claude Code wiring. `stet claude` writes machine-specific paths here
# until stetmark is installed globally, so it is per-developer, not shared.
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# Agent instruction surfaces stet writes into, when generated here by testing.
CLAUDE.md
.cursorrules
.cursor/
.windsurfrules
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# Packing artefacts
*.tgz

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# macOS and editors
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
